{"id":"en_poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything","title":"Poor? I Own the Cure for Everything!","titleEn":"Poor? I Own the Cure for Everything!","description":"A young man of mysterious origins comes into possession of age-old and highly advanced medical knowledge. After a modest clinic takes him on as its village doctor, his treatments draw in a steady stream of aristocratic patients and earn him a reputation that spreads far and wide. His remarkable abilities, however, also spark envy and ill will among others. The story follows this gifted figure as he uses his healing skills to carve out his own way forward and overcome every formidable adversary who stands against him.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Underdog Rise","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsa3m/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_poor-i-own-the-cure-for-everything_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"